Eduka-Transparan - Edukasaun OS dark glass theme.

Inspired by Transparent-Shell-Theme by mrbrownstone07
(https://github.com/mrbrownstone07/Transparent-Shell-Theme), a GNOME Shell
theme. GNOME Shell CSS cannot style LXQt, so its palette was taken over and
redrawn for Eduka-Panel, Eduka-Desktop, the Action Center and popups:
rgba(26,26,26,0.95) surfaces, rgba(217,217,217,0.08) controls,
rgba(242,242,242,1) text and 15 px radii. Window borders are generated by
tools/gen-wm-themes.py; GTK applications use Edukasaun-Dark.
Without a compositor Eduka-Transparan falls back to Edukasaun-Dark.
